                                  (Z_to_bv 64 D) (Z_to_bv 64 (2 ^ s)) a2' a3' (Z_to_bv 64 p2) (Z_to_bv 64 s) (Z_to_bv 64 buf) (Z_to_bv 64 lenp) s2x s3x s4 s5 s6 s7 s8 s9 s10 s11
